<text><body><div type="page" n="147"><pb n="147" facs="#f0159"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">3. Die Mundart.</fw>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p147-b1" facs="#f0159-b1"><lb n="1" facs="#f0159-l1"/><placeName ref="#place-leumnitz">Leumnitz</placeName>.</ab>
<p xml:id="p147-b2">'<lb n="2" facs="#f0159-l2"/>s gang e Semonn aus z' sen sen Som un indam ar sete, ful Enig's <lb n="3" facs="#f0159-l3"/>an d'n Wagk un word v'rtrat'n un de <name type="organism" ref="#organism-vogel">Bugel</name> unnern Himmel froß'ns uff. Un <lb n="4" facs="#f0159-l4"/>Enig's that uff'n <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-fels">Fels</rs> fall'n un do's uffgang, v'rdurrt's dorim, doß 's kenn <lb n="5" facs="#f0159-l5"/>Soft nich hotte. Un Enig's that mitt'n unn'r de Durrn fall'n un de Durrn <lb n="6" facs="#f0159-l6"/>that'n uffgihn un d'rschtickt'ns. Un Enig's that uff gut Land fall'n un uffgihn <lb n="7" facs="#f0159-l7"/>un trug hunnertfelt'ge Frucht. War Urn hot z' hern, dar hēre.</p>
<p xml:id="p147-b3"><lb n="8" facs="#f0159-l8"/><placeName ref="#place-thraendorf">Thrändorf</placeName>.</p>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p147-b4" facs="#f0159-b4"><lb n="9" facs="#f0159-l9"/><placeName ref="#place-grossaga">Großaga</placeName>.</ab>
<p xml:id="p147-b5"><lb n="10" facs="#f0159-l10"/>Ich dächte nu, noch menner Ort<lb/><lb n="11" facs="#f0159-l11"/>Wull ich dos Deng ganz anners deite.<lb/><lb n="12" facs="#f0159-l12"/>Ich ben zwor nich su huch gelort,<lb/><lb n="13" facs="#f0159-l13"/>Wie du, doß ich mit Harrn konn streite,<lb/><lb n="14" facs="#f0159-l14"/>Dach dächt ich, doß dergleichen Sochen<lb/><lb n="15" facs="#f0159-l15"/>De jonge Parschel selber mochen.</p>
<p xml:id="p147-b6"><lb n="16" facs="#f0159-l16"/>Wu holbg a jonger Pursche kon<lb/><lb n="17" facs="#f0159-l17"/>Drei Wartel met an Medel kuse<lb/><lb n="18" facs="#f0159-l18"/>Un's Medel hot Gefolln doron,<lb/><lb n="19" facs="#f0159-l19"/>Glei wards en Arnst un ha werd luse.<lb/><lb n="20" facs="#f0159-l20"/>A Wittmonn ober schlecht ganz schtille,<lb/><lb n="21" facs="#f0159-l21"/>Ha denkt, dos Medel werd glei wille.</p>
<p xml:id="p147-b7"><lb n="22" facs="#f0159-l22"/>Un su wullns a de Medel ho.<lb/><lb n="23" facs="#f0159-l23"/>War met Gewalt well uff se starme,<lb/><lb n="24" facs="#f0159-l24"/>Dan well ich in Vertrauen so,<lb/><lb n="25" facs="#f0159-l25"/>Ha kreit nischt vun dan ganzen Larme.<lb/><lb n="26" facs="#f0159-l26"/>Dann war well kluge <name type="organism" ref="#organism-vogel">Bugel</name> fange,<lb/><lb n="27" facs="#f0159-l27"/>Dar weißt den Leim nich uff der Stange.</p>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p147-b8" facs="#f0159-b8"><lb n="28" facs="#f0159-l28"/>b) Im Oberlande.</ab>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p147-b9" facs="#f0159-b9"><lb n="29" facs="#f0159-l29"/>Triebes.</ab>
<p xml:id="p147-b10"><lb n="30" facs="#f0159-l30"/>Sohn. Vöt'r, de Leit thun nu olle sog'n, 's wärsch 's <name type="organism" ref="#organism-roggen">Korn</name> olls bei uns <lb n="31" facs="#f0159-l31"/>d'rfrurn; ich wor obb'r drauß'n un hob net viel gesahn, es soch gu noch olls <lb n="32" facs="#f0159-l32"/>ganz grinn.</p>
<p xml:id="p147-b11"><lb n="33" facs="#f0159-l33"/>Vater. De host's <name type="organism" ref="#organism-roggen">Korn</name> net racht ong'sahn. Erscht soch'n de <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-acker">Ecker</rs> ganz <lb n="34" facs="#f0159-l34"/>weiß; itze is dos, wos noch net ausgeschoßt war, ibber dos d'rfrurne in <lb n="35" facs="#f0159-l35"/>de Heh gewochs'n un m'r denkt, 's is widd'r grinn. Wenn obbers Drasch'n lus <lb n="36" facs="#f0159-l36"/>gitt, do werd vum Schuck epp'r e Vertel warn. Un do dos d'rfrurne nimm'r <lb n="37" facs="#f0159-l37"/>wechst, su werd a wenger Schtruh. Un wenn nu vollkst Kriek warn sellt, su <lb n="38" facs="#f0159-l38"/>wirsch vern Bau'r un vern Handwerksmonn schlacht wärn, do uff manch'n Flack'n <lb n="39" facs="#f0159-l39"/>de <name type="organism" ref="#organism-kartoffel">Erdepfeln</name> net orntlich uffgenn un a weng Aussicht uff Futt'rbau is.</p>
<p xml:id="p147-b12"><lb n="40" facs="#f0159-l40"/>S. Vöt'r, he, denk d'ersch nor, ich wor itze driem 'n Schtenbruch, Herre, <lb n="41" facs="#f0159-l41"/>do kom unn'r Nochb'r vun d'r Arg'rniß, dar hotte su sär g'soff'n. Itze kom '<lb n="42" facs="#f0159-l42"/>r nu ūm rei g'dolzt un ful g'rode nei'n Schtenbruch. Do homm'n de Leit <lb n="43" facs="#f0159-l43"/>rei'n sei Haus g'trog'n. Do kom gleich sei Fra raus, di sät: Gî nor um Gutts <lb n="44" facs="#f0159-l44"/>will'n En'r nuff zu'n Dukt'r. Wie d'r Dukt'r kom, sät'r, 's wär ke Hilf, dar <lb n="45" facs="#f0159-l45"/>meßt schtarm. Un itze is'r glei g'schtorm.</p>
<p xml:id="p147-b13"><lb n="46" facs="#f0159-l46"/>S. He Vöt'r, de Leit thun sog'n, hei'r wier obb'r viel <name type="organism" ref="#organism-getreide">G'trēde</name> g'baut.<lb n="47" facs="#f0159-l47"/> <name type="organism" ref="#organism-ruebsen">Riebs'n</name>, <name type="organism" ref="#organism-flachs">Lein</name> un <name type="organism" ref="#organism-raps">Kopps</name>, di gäm su sär viel Fl. Wenn thun 'nn mîr unn'<lb n="48" facs="#f0159-l48"/>r <name type="organism" ref="#organism-roggen">Korn</name> ômoch'n?</p>
<p xml:id="p147-b14">10 *</p>
</div></body></text>
